  "description": "Native Python implementation of the Waveform Database (WFDB) standard for reading, writing, and processing physiological signal data. The primary I/O library for PhysioNet datasets — including MIMIC-III Waveforms, MIT-BIH Arrhythmia Database, and PTB-XL ECG dataset. Supports ECG, arterial blood pressure, EEG, and other time-series waveforms alongside their clinical annotations (beat labels, rhythm labels, clinical events). Maintained by the MIT Laboratory for Computational Physiology, the same group behind MIMIC and PhysioNet.",
